{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../InviteLinkImporter/", "title": "InviteLinkImporter"}, "next": {"link": "../RtmpUrl/", "title": "RtmpUrl"}, "title": "Restriction", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"restriction\">\n<h1>Restriction<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#restriction\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.Restriction\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Restriction</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.Restriction\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>A restriction applied to bots or chats.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>platform</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 The platform the restriction is applied to, e.g. \u201cios\u201d, \u201candroid\u201d</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>reason</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 The restriction reason, e.g. \u201cporn\u201d, \u201ccopyright\u201d.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>text</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>) \u2013 The restriction text.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/RtmpUrl", "RtmpUrl", "N", "next"], ["api/types/InviteLinkImporter", "InviteLinkImporter", "P", "previous"]], "sourcena